## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let n be parseInt(item 2 of args()).
Let mutable input be a new Seq of Float.
Let mutable output be a new Seq of Float.
Repeat for i from 1 to n:
    Push ((i * 5 + 3) % 8) / 8.0 to input.
    Push 0.0 to output.
Let t1 be 0.125.
Let t2 be 0.25.
Let t3 be 0.5.
Let t4 be 1.0.
Let mutable i be 4.
While i + 3 is at most n:
    Set item i of output to t1 * item (i - 3) of input + t2 * item (i - 2) of input + t3 * item (i - 1) of input + t4 * item i of input + t3 * item (i + 1) of input + t2 * item (i + 2) of input + t1 * item (i + 3) of input.
    Set i to i + 1.
Let mutable checksum be 0.0.
Repeat for v in output:
    Set checksum to checksum + v.
Show checksum.
